u want and have fun adding  endless unique detail to your own custom  worlds scanning is the best and i am  officially addicted i hope you all have  as much fun as i'm having during this  process you can download reality capture  in the description for free use the code  punisher 100 to get 10 worth of points  to get scanning right now the ppi system  they have is cool because you only pay  on export for your total megapixel count  so you can scan and test as much as you  want until you're ready to use your  points and it's actually all pretty  affordable in the end also i want to  shout out william foshea's channel  because halfway through making this  video i found out william was doing a  video on photo scanning as well so we  managed to sync up and cover slightly  different topics for you guys if you  want to see how he scanned this cabin  click the link in the description below  and finally if you want to get your  hands on my onewheel scan and all the  other scans i made while honing my  workflow they're all up on my patreon  pro tier along with all my packs  textures and bts content y'all thank you  so much for watching this video thanks  for watching this channel this year it  has been a crazy year especially since  leaving corridor and leaning full time  into this channel  i have a ton of stuff that i want to get  into in 2022 and can't wait to knock it  out with y'all y'all have been so  supportive and i cannot thank you enough  for learning and growing with me it's  been amazing so let's keep learning  let's keep growing let's get scanning  and happy holidays to each and every one  of y'all i'll see you in 2022.  peace  if you want a photo scanning challenge  over the holiday break i'm running one  this week in my discord server the links  in the description  come hone your scanning workflow with us  it'll be a good time  [Music]
 

